  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It is a fully developed Toe Biter and uses a highly aggressive moveset. It combines melee attacks, area hits, ranged attacks, and can release gas around itself to control space.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is one of the most dangerous Toe Biters and can feel almost like a miniboss. It has a huge amount of health, varied attacks, and enough damage to severely punish several mistakes in a row, so its fights are usually long.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It is one of the strongest predators among Toe Biters and can fight other creatures that enter its territory. Its enormous durability lets it remain in combat for a long time even against enemies that would quickly kill smaller variants.",
  "strategy": "If you do not have much experience fighting Toe Biters yet, it may be better to wait before challenging it. The fight is usually long, and dying after several minutes is quite easy if you do not know its attacks well. Once prepared, use Spicy damage, avoid Slashing weapons, and take opportunities to hit its rear weak point. Keep enough space to react to area attacks and gas, and dodge its unblockable ranged attack instead of trying to block it.",
